Here is the complete `launch.json` example from the README:

```json
{
    "version": "0.2.0",
    "configurations": [
        {
            "name": "Launch Rhinoceros",
            "type": "rhino",
            "request": "launch",
            "runtimeExecutable": "/Applications/Rhinoceros.app/Contents/MacOS/Rhinoceros",
            "passDebugOptionsViaEnvironmentVariable": true,
            "env": {
                "RHINO_PLUGIN_PATH": "${workspaceFolder}/Path/To/MyPlugin.rhp",
                "GRASSHOPPER_PLUGINS": "${workspaceFolder}/Path/To/MyGHPlugin.gha"
            }
        }
    ]
}
```

This configuration demonstrates how to set up debugging for Rhinoceros plugins using VS Code. The environment variables shown are optional and allow you to specify plugin paths during the debugging session.

